RefreshOptimizationStatus	Refresh status (F5)	刷新状态（F5）
RefreshingOptimizationStatus	Refreshing optimization status...	正在刷新优化状态……
OptimizationStatusRefreshFinished	Optimization status refreshed	优化状态已刷新
OptimizationStatusRefreshPartial	Refresh finished; {0} item(s) could not be checked. See logs for details.	刷新完成，{0} 项检测失败，请查看日志。
OptimizationStatusRefreshFailed	Failed to refresh optimization status. Please try again.	刷新优化状态失败，请重试。
